{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_title", "source_sha256": "c5ca5935895e82c68d1d9190d7b08a8e0f16e99a2bdb4ef5705b14483c6a53ee", "ja": "茜とおでかけ2", "zh": "和茜出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ba3bb22bc3d1d976aa038a6d532c6db43c81fe9f8f9bc50b17c43c9eb65507eb", "ja": "茜とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和茜一同出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9feb6051ec986524333f9db456a49c06955f4939d043f8657bd5ae26a5c1a5f8", "ja": "（予定より早く仕事を終えた茜にねだられ、カラオケに\nやってきた。もはや、茜の独壇場となっている……）", "zh": "（茜比预定时间更早结束了工作，缠着我来了卡拉OK。现在已经完全成了茜的个人舞台……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "16039de147e980737bd2945e9724231a5979f4b0d08f56fa2bf016fea4c0270e", "ja": "いえーい！　じゃあいくよ！\nみんなのアイドル茜ちゃんの、23曲目～！", "zh": "耶——！那就开始啦！接下来是大家的偶像小茜的第23首歌～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8f7b5d6fb4e69571b7548df4dfcc2bbde66dcde1c9275f07d21423550aec3c96", "ja": "いえーい。あ、か、ね～。……。", "zh": "耶——。茜——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "847eda5705813f0d392f999a4011918a0c50fd384106f56e8ccc63ad6d46e1a2", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、もう疲れちゃったの？\nそんなんじゃ、プロデューサー神にはなれないゾ☆", "zh": "{$P$}，这就累趴下了吗？\n这样的话，可成不了制作人之神哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0c2a354c1f1683ae554ff83ed31f900e6a89c6c8581ce1f1246a8510e6d8d4f1", "ja": "どんな神なんだ、それは……。\n茜こそ、仕事の後なのによく歌い続けられるな？", "zh": "那算什么神啊……  \n茜才是，明明刚工作完，居然还能一直唱下去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "6f9c8f4a6faa887673c00e2b0400e3505245145c49a5b328567afc95852ec1c6", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、{$P$}ちゃんの\nアイドルだからね！　これもファンサービスだよ♪", "zh": "因为小茜可是{$P$}的偶像嘛！这也是给粉丝的福利哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "2037868affa70f52b0d0d8a05df741bc4494300874bfc80b5ec2b4d09a38eaef", "ja": "しょうがないなー。茜ちゃん単独ライブはお開きに\nして、奈良名物のおいしいものでも食べに行こっか？", "zh": "没办法啦——先让小茜的个人演唱会到此为止，去吃点奈良特产的美食吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4dd925de7bd7ec9c65d478669411b2aadce1c91874b2b965d1541d9df1c96e79", "ja": "いつの間に単独ライブになっていたんだ……\nでも、そうだな。茜もそろそろお腹が空いたよな。", "zh": "不知不觉怎么就变成个人演唱会了……\n不过，说得也是。茜也差不多该饿了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed692d677c2561d486e9e2e84708a0f72b35a21d7be98418a94a4437c705f90f", "ja": "うんうん。そういうことにしておいてあげるから、\nよろしくね、{$P$}ちゃん♪", "zh": "嗯嗯。那就当作是这么回事吧，我就先顺着你啦，拜托咯，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8d4a1350cdc99df67655d8fba16671da66105c0a6d7f79a2efc025a24fc469b2", "ja": "（茜といると、ついペースに乗せられてしまう。\n不思議と、それが楽しいような気がするな）", "zh": "（和茜待在一起，总是不知不觉就被她带着走。\n但不可思议的是，我好像觉得这样也挺开心的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
